","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"graphify knowledge graph (graphify-out)","rationale":"Project maintains a knowledge graph with god nodes, community structure, and cross-file relationships to answer codebase questions faster than raw grep or source reads.","source_file":"AGENTS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"agents_graphify_query","label":"graphify query / path / explain Commands","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":0,"community_name":"Graphify Knowledge Graph (graphify-out)","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"graphify query / path / explain commands","rationale":"Scoped subgraph retrieval (query for questions, path for relationships, explain for concepts) that returns far smaller output than GRAPH_REPORT.md or raw grep, and must run before any grep/search/source read when graph.json exists.","source_file":"AGENTS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"agents_graphify_update","label":"graphify update Command","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":0,"community_name":"Graphify Knowledge Graph (graphify-out)","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"graphify update command","rationale":"Keeps the knowledge graph current after code modifications; AST-only rebuild with no API cost, so there is no reason to skip it.","source_file":"AGENTS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"agents_graph_json","label":"graphify-out/graph.json","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":0,"community_name":"Graphify Knowledge Graph (graphify-out)","contributor":null,"file_type":"document","norm_label":"graphify-out/graph.json","rationale":"Committed graph file rewritten whole on every build; large diffs to it in a pull request are expected and should not be flagged as churn.","source_file":"AGENTS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"agents_graph_report","label":"graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":0,"community_name":"Graphify Knowledge Graph (graphify-out)","contributor":null,"file_type":"document","norm_label":"graphify-out/graph_report.md","rationale":"Broad architecture report to read only when query/path/explain do not surface enough context, since it is much larger than a scoped subgraph.","source_file":"AGENTS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"agents_wiki_index","label":"graphify-out/wiki/index.md","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":0,"community_name":"Graphify Knowledge Graph (graphify-out)","contributor":null,"file_type":"document","norm_label":"graphify-out/wiki/index.md","rationale":"Broad navigation entry point that should be preferred over raw source browsing when it exists.","source_file":"AGENTS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"ref_node_path","label":"ref_node_path","community":3,"community_name":"class.ts","external":true,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"ref_node_path","source_file":"","type":"external"},{"id":"ref_node_process","label":"ref_node_process","community":3,"community_name":"class.ts","external":true,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"ref_node_process","source_file":"","type":"external"},{"id":"ref_node_url","label":"ref_node_url","community":3,"community_name":"class.ts","external":true,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"ref_node_url","source_file":"","type":"external"},{"id":"ref_node_stream","label":"ref_node_stream","community":5,"community_name":"application.ts","external":true,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"ref_node_stream","source_file":"","type":"external"},{"id":"ref_node_buffer","label":"ref_node_buffer","community":8,"community_name":"class.ts","external":true,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"ref_node_buffer","source_file":"","type":"external"}],"links":[{"source":"github_workflows_ci_verify_steps","target":"github_workflows_ci_steps_name","relation":"contains","_origin